                    f"support is +/-{spec['target_x']:.3f} m by "
                    f"+/-{spec['target_y']:.3f} m. RMP-target publication "
                    f"hold probability/tail is {spec['hold']:.3f}/"
                    f"{spec['hold_tail']:.3f}, with the measured 2--9 tick "
                    "tail enabled only in the late lessons. Ball/racket "
                    "horizontal velocity, full racket angular speed, view, "
